        {
          "text": "Nkabela bakalya Pasika mumwezi mutaanzi, mubuzuba bwakumi aane bwamumwezi, ciindi cagoko, oko kunkanda ya-Sinai; mbubonya mbuli Jehova mbwaakalailila Musa mbubonya obo ba-Israyeli mbubakacita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.5",
