        {
          "text": "Pele kakuli bamwi bantu ibakasofweede nkaambo kakuguma mutunta, aboobo bakakacilwa kulya Pasika mubuzuba obo, Aba bantu bakaswena kuli ba-Musa a-Aroni mubuzuba obo mbubonya, ",
